      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "The cited bundle explicitly identifies slow or retried reads as a hypothesis rather than a finding."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C005_SIGNAL",
    "value": "The operation separates export phase durations where trace semantics permit. The read-related branch of the proposed signal is ordinary queue waits followed by a prolonged, comparably measured object-read phase.",
    "scope": "A proposed comparative observation, assumed to occur for this assessment; it does not establish why reads are prolonged or specifically demonstrate retries.",
